{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"So in the vampire larp i was in, I did a month of research on homemade bomb making, just so i could make grenades aggravated damage rather than lethal.\n\nSo yes, more oil doesn't burn hotter, in fact even if you tried to compress it, it wouldn't burn hotter, but the heat would expand and possibly allow for the equivalent of a nail bomb rather than incendiary.\n\nIts like a Molotov, the side of the bottle determines how much spread and how long it can burn.","created_at":"2021-08-24T18:49:29.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879799596434456666","reply_to_id":"879798044000935946","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
