{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"yeah... I learned likely more than I should have at the time, but hey, its been helpful for other games.\n\nlike did you know the reason that the FBI can figure out who made a bomb is people are superstitious.  Basically when you don't blow yourself up the first time, you try to replicate every step exactly for a higher chance of not blowing up.  this includes exact mixtures of chemicals, and weird stuff like, you tighten the cap on the pipe all the way, then loosen it 1/4 turn or whatever.  All that becomes your signature, and thus you become far easier to find the more you do it","created_at":"2021-08-24T18:54:38.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879800892604424293","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
